Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.10,0:00:01.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The little prince
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.61,0:00:03.04,Default,,0,0,0,,landed on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He came to a big garden.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.54,0:00:07.20,Default,,0,0,0,,And in that garden,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.20,0:00:09.38,Default,,0,0,0,,roses bloomed everywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.38,0:00:10.63,Default,,0,0,0,,One thousand,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.63,0:00:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,two thousand...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.12,0:00:14.10,Default,,0,0,0,,five thousand roses!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.10,0:00:15.43,Default,,0,0,0,,The little prince
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.43,0:00:16.99,Default,,0,0,0,,couldn't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.00,0:00:19.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought my rose was the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.00,0:00:21.01,Default,,0,0,0,,only one in the universe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.01,0:00:23.23,Default,,0,0,0,,But she has five thousand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.23,0:00:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,sisters, all the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.19,0:00:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The little prince sat on the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.64,0:00:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,grass, feeling sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.30,0:00:31.44,Default,,0,0,0,,His rose had told him she
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.44,0:00:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,was one of a kind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.98,0:00:33.83,Default,,0,0,0,,But here,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.83,0:00:35.67,Default,,0,0,0,,every rose said the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.67,0:00:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.74,0:00:39.25,Default,,0,0,0,,My rose is just an ordinary
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.25,0:00:41.01,Default,,0,0,0,,flower, he thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.01,0:00:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Just then,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.21,0:00:44.01,Default,,0,0,0,,a fox appeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.01,0:00:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, said the fox,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.69,0:00:47.97,Default,,0,0,0,,those five thousand roses
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.97,0:00:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,do look the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.51,0:00:51.10,Default,,0,0,0,,But your rose is
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.10,0:00:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,different.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.10,0:00:54.19,Default,,0,0,0,,You watered her.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.19,0:00:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,You protected her
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.78,0:00:57.10,Default,,0,0,0,,from the wind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.10,0:00:58.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You listened to her
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.61,0:01:00.61,Default,,0,0,0,,complaints and her pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.61,0:01:02.49,Default,,0,0,0,,You put a glass cover
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.49,0:01:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,over her at night.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.10,0:01:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the time you spent with her
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.36,0:01:07.60,Default,,0,0,0,,that makes her so
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.60,0:01:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,important.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.33,0:01:10.45,Default,,0,0,0,,You become responsible for
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.45,0:01:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,what you've tamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.92,0:01:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The little prince
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.54,0:01:14.49,Default,,0,0,0,,looked up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.49,0:01:15.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, he said,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.60,0:01:17.77,Default,,0,0,0,,my rose is more important
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.77,0:01:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,than all of you together.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.94,0:01:22.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Because she is MY rose.
